/*
  AITCONarration.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 shared surface · 0052 · AITCONarration (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native
  `AITCONarration` resolves (table "AITCONarration") lives here with its web English
  value. These entries fold into the app `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog at integration time;
  they are kept in a per-surface table so each parallel surface prompt owns its own strings without
  editing the shared catalog.

  The first group is the parity set extracted from the web source
  (web/src/components/ai/AITCONarration.tsx + the shared AIFeatureCard / AiOutputPanel /
  AIThinkingIndicator literals it composes). The second group backs the native P4 leaf chrome (the
  freshness / connectivity / loading / error copy) so the Swift sources hold no English prose.
*/

/* --- Parity: the web source's t(key, default) calls --- */
"tco.aiNarration.title" = "Explain my total cost of ownership";
"tco.aiNarration.description" = "Ask Helix to walk through the deterministic operating-cost figures shown below — the EV charging spend, the equivalent gas cost, the cumulative savings, and the cost-per-kilometre comparison. The narrator quotes the same numbers the chart shows and is honest about the four limiting assumptions: operating cost only (no depreciation, resale, insurance, registration, or financing); a flat $50/month maintenance heuristic; equivalent gas cost estimated from charged energy not real-world distance; and gas-price / efficiency / electricity-rate defaults from your editable Settings.";
"tco.aiNarration.button" = "Explain ownership cost";
"tco.aiNarration.badge" = "Helix";
"tco.aiNarration.noVehicleHint" = "Pick a vehicle above to enable Helix.";

